<Base title="Privacy · vikrantsingh.fyi">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>This site sets no cookies and runs no ad or tracking scripts.</p>
  <p>
    The site's own logs record one line per request: time, page path, status, duration and outcome. They do not
    record your IP address or browser details, and the site has no forms that ask for personal information.
    Cloudflare, which hosts the site, handles your IP address to deliver the page, under its own privacy policy.
  </p>
  <p>
    The site keeps one running total of page views. It is a single number; nothing about you or your visit is
    stored with it.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you play <a href="/play/">Pulse run</a>, the game sends anonymous events to this site: when a run starts and
    ends, the score, script errors, and frame timings. They are tied to a random ID made fresh on each page load and
    are not stored with your IP address, browser details or any cookie. They appear only as totals on
    <a href="/reliability/">Live reliability</a>.
  </p>
  <p>If you email me, I keep that conversation in my own inbox like any other email.</p>
